    {
      "type": "h",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Steps"
    },
    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        "Log the request on the day it arrives (lib-dsr-form).",
        "Confirm the requester’s identity.",
        "Decide who is responsible: the school or the company. If the school, pass it on the same day.",
        "Find the data. Use the platform’s purpose-checked access, not a direct database query.",
        "Check for a legal reason to refuse or limit. Counsel decides.",
        "Respond in writing within [Fill in: response time set by counsel].",
        "Record the outcome. A deletion goes through the retention and tombstone path, never a manual delete."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Do not"
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        "Delete anything by hand in the data store.",
        "Send personal information by unprotected email."
      ]
    },
